    "text": "1 days ago Momentum continues to build for McMinnville Landing as the project advances into its next phase of planning, infrastructure coordination, and site promotion. Following completion of the McMinnville Landing Master Plan and ongoing infrastructure planning efforts led by the City of McMinnville, property owners are now partnering with the McMinnville Economic Development Partnership (MEDP) to actively market and position the site for future development opportunities. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
